  "summary": "Security-research / proof-of-concept package: test89-auth (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook runs index.js, which fingerprints the host (hostname, platform, OS release, CPU/memory, whoami, id, pwd, uname -a), enumerates the filesystem under /, /home, /opt, /var/www and /tmp, then exfiltrates the collected data via DNS queries to the callback domain dfwstre3dgnrhwm2bvkczgucc3iv6lua[.]oastify[.]com. Data is base64-encoded, split into 50-character chunks, and sent as nslookup queries of the form s.\u003csessionId\u003e.\u003cchunkCount\u003e.\u003cchunk\u003e.\u003cdomain\u003e.",
